==Restrictions==
*Fixed lineup: [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark Cat]], [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Sifu Cat]], [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Lumbercat]], [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Heavyweight Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]].

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
To start off, wait for the Zrocos to spawn, and as you do, grind for money and [[Worker Cat]] levels. About 3 should be doable. Then send out [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter cat]] to cause the zombies to burrow, and then spam meatshields and [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark Cat]]. Once the Zory spawns, wait for it to pop up, and then send in your [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Heavyweight Cats]] and [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Lumbercats]], and keep spamming Dark Cat for the second St. Pigge the 2nds. It might take a few attempts, but thankfully it costs no energy, so it's easy to retry.

==Hints==
The first hint can be viewed within the Enemies Appearing window before beginning the stage. The second only appears as a defeat message given after failing it.
*Zombies will burrow underground<br>when near a Cat unit.<br>Counter this maneuver by pacing<br>unit deployment accordingly.
*Zombies burrow into the ground to split<br>your forces and expose your frontline.<br>Save up Money to respond to the coming<br>threat with a second wave of deployments!

